`--dry-run` resolves config and arguments, prints the call it would make, and never reaches
the provider.

-- cmd --
booping-tracker --dry-run relate --issue LIN-1 --to LIN-2
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
dry-run relate LIN-1: cli driver, would call issue='LIN-1' relation='related' to='LIN-2'
-- stderr --
